rate offsets and overlaps are fine; no gradients, radius or soft shadows, and links are underlined"}},{"id":"orderg-x__cream","type":"style","rev":"08e9e40834f9","title":{"zh":"奶油风","en":"Cream"},"description":{"zh":"奶白燕麦焦糖、大圆角、柔光","en":"Milk, oat and caramel, big radii, soft light"},"license":"CC0-1.0","author":{"login":"orderg-x","id":271418316},"ai":{"generated":true,"tool":"dsh-design-studio@0.11.0"},"digest":"f80b9ec84f4fd6bacecf43fcafb57d1439bd1462e6e54c8e3a4ee581c634942a","bytes":1233,"added":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","updated":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","minPlugin":"0.11.0","style":{"c":{"bg":"#FAF5EE","surface":"#FFFDF9","text":"#3A2F28","muted":"#76675C","line":"#EEE3D5","primary":"#8C5E3C","accent":"#E7C9A6","on":"#FFFFFF","link":"#8A5A36"},"head":"ROUND","w":700,"radius":22,"shadow":"0 10px 30px rgba(140,94,60,.10)","dzh":"奶白燕麦焦糖、大圆角、柔光","den":"Milk, oat and caramel, big radii, soft light","nzh":"只用奶白、燕麦、焦糖三色；圆角大，多用圆形和胶囊形；阴影又大又淡、带暖色，字用深咖啡色；照片和插画柔光低对比，整体软、暖、安静","nen":"Milk, oat and caramel only; big radii, lots of circles and pills; large faint warm shadows, dark coffee text instead of black; soft low-contrast photos and illustrations, calm and warm overall"}},{"id":"orderg-x__cute","type":"style","rev":"08e9e40834f9","title":{"zh":"可爱卡通","en":"Cute"},"description":{"zh":"粉黄糖果色、大圆角、圆体字","en":"Candy pink and yellow, big radii, rounded type"},"license":"CC0-1.0","author":{"login":"orderg-x","id":271418316},"ai":{"generated":true,"tool":"dsh-design-studio@0.11.0"},"digest":"da6d008b5ab20746e0a633beb185a62a72412569354dafa699b5d09a080fb256","bytes":1216,"added":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","updated":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","minPlugin":"0.11.0","style":{"c":{"bg":"#FFF4F6","surface":"#FFFFFF","text":"#3A2540","muted":"#7A5E80","line":"#F3D3DD","primary":"#FF7AA8","accent":"#FFC93C","on":"#3A2540","link":"#C2366F"},"head":"ROUND","w":800,"radius":24,"shadow":"0 6px 0 #F3C4D3","dzh":"粉黄糖果色、大圆角、圆体字","den":"Candy pink and yellow, big radii, rounded type","nzh":"圆角很大、字胖胖的；按钮像糖果，底下一道同色系厚阴影；配简单几何画的小动物或角色插画；只用粉黄两色，主色按钮上用深色字","nen":"Very round corners and chubby type; candy-like buttons with a thick same-hue shadow; small animal or mascot illustrations in simple SVG shapes; pink and yellow only, dark text on the primary button"}},{"id":"orderg-x__cyber","type":"style","rev":"08e9e40834f9","title":{"zh":"赛博朋克","en":"Cyberpunk"},"description":{"zh":"近黑底、品红青色霓虹、等宽字","en":"Near-black, magenta and cyan neon, monospace"},"license":"CC0-1.0","author":{"login":"orderg-x","id":271418316},"ai":{"generated":true,"tool":"dsh-design-studio@0.11.0"},"digest":"b6fac9122f82fb5cf736f64d78bb41be49eae782005cae319a98d722e24d7bed","bytes":1316,"added":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","updated":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","minPlugin":"0.11.0","style":{"c":{"bg":"#0B0B16","surface":"#151528","text":"#E9E6FF","muted":"#A09CC8","line":"#2E2B52","primary":"#FF2E88","accent":"#22E1FF","on":"#0B0B16","link":"#22E1FF"},"head":"MONO","w":700,"radius":2,"shadow":"0 0 0 1px #FF2E88, 0 0 18px rgba(255,46,136,.45)","dzh":"近黑底、品红青色霓虹、等宽字","den":"Near-black, magenta and cyan neon, monospace","nzh":"标题用等宽字、全大写，可以加一点故障错位（两层彩色 text-shadow）；边框是 1px 霓虹线加外发光，发光只给主按钮和关键数字；背景可以叠细网格线；正文照样要清楚","nen":"Monospace, all-caps headings with a slight glitch (two colored text-shadows); 1px neon borders with glow, glow only on the main button and key numbers; a fine grid on the background is fine; body text stays readable"}},{"id":"orderg-x__dark","type":"style","rev":"08e9e40834f9","title":{"zh":"深色高级","en":"Dark luxe"},"description":{"zh":"近黑底、香槟金点缀、大图","en":"Near-black, champagne gold accents, big imagery"},"license":"CC0-1.0","author":{"login":"orderg-x","id":271418316},"ai":{"generated":true,"tool":"dsh-design-studio@0.11.0"},"digest":"f42f706ff05ccdac58c06cb075aa1c461fb2b89bb8cfb9bcf69e87402842d5e6","bytes":1111,"added":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","updated":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","minPlugin":"0.11.0","style":{"c":{"bg":"#0E0E10","surface":"#18181B","text":"#F2EFE9","muted":"#A19C93","line":"#2C2C30","primary":"#C9A86A","accent":"#E8E2D6","on":"#17140E","link":"#C9A86A"},"head":"SERIF","w":500,"radius":12,"shadow":"0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45)","dzh":"近黑底、香槟金点缀、大图","den":"Near-black, champagne gold accents, big imagery","nzh":"金色只点在关键按钮和细线上；层级靠表面色深浅，不靠阴影；标题细一点、字距放开；留白要多","nen":"Gold only on key buttons and fine lines; layers from surface shades, not shadows; lighter, tracked-out headings; generous space"}},{"id":"orderg-x__editorial","type":"style","rev":"08e9e40834f9","title":{"zh":"杂志编辑","en":"Editorial"},"description":{"zh":"大标题、黑线栅格、红色点题","en":"Big headlines, black-rule grid, a red accent"},"license":"CC0-1.0","author":{"login":"orderg-x","id":271418316},"ai":{"generated":true,"tool":"dsh-design-studio@0.11.0"},"digest":"3d55d9a7f8b655e28be03b63625b0b87172352061a96fcf941364b33fc9e1b35","bytes":1150,"added":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","updated":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","minPlugin":"0.11.0","style":{"c":{"bg":"#F4F1EA","surface":"#FFFFFF","text":"#111111","muted":"#555555","line":"#111111","primary":"#C8231B","accent":"#111111","on":"#FFFFFF","link":"#C8231B"},"head":"SERIF","w":700,"radius":2,"shadow":"none","dzh":"大标题、黑线栅格、红色点题","den":"Big headlines, black-rule grid, a red accent","nzh":"标题很大、粗细对比强烈；用粗细两种黑线分栏；版式不对称、留白多；红色只点一两处，几乎不用圆角和阴影","nen":"Very large headlines with strong weight contrast; thick and thin black rules for columns; asymmetric layout with space; red in one or two places, almost no radius or shadow"}},{"id":"orderg-x__fresh","type":"style","rev":"08e9e40834f9","title":{"zh":"清新自然","en":"Fresh"},"description":{"zh":"浅绿底、圆角卡片、轻插画","en":"Pale green, rounded cards, light illustration"},"license":"CC0-1.0","author":{"login":"orderg-x","id":271418316},"ai":{"generated":true,"tool":"dsh-design-studio@0.11.0"},"digest":"6bc22a5a9275a4a57fa4cb57ac1ce29335b6533a8c8498ba4540003596f64a9c","bytes":1101,"added":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","updated":"2026-11-07T08:27:20+09:00","minPlugin":"0.11.0","style":{"c":{"bg":"#F3F7F2","s